The read-only WCDB/SQLCipher acquisition implementation in
skills/wechat-persona/scripts/wechat_source.py adapts the page layout,
Config.Cipher discovery approach, and sender namespace handling documented in:
  wechatauto-replica, by fanyuantaier and contributors
  https://github.com/fanyuantaier/wechatauto-replica
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Adaptations include in-memory database deserialization, authenticated WAL
commit handling, selected-contact export, and removal of persistent key caches
and full plaintext database files. This project is not an upstream release.

